Additional note. This note does not change the MIT terms above.

The engine stub in this repository is MIT. A later integration of Open
Community Edition (https://github.com/OpenCommunityEdition/OpenCE) is
expected to bring in code licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License, version 3 or any later version (AGPL-3.0-or-later).

OpenCE's own README describes the split: current OpenCE is AGPL-3.0-or-later,
while snapshots from before that project's AGPL transition stay CC0 1.0.
Linking AGPL OpenCE code into a binary of this project would make that
combined work subject to the AGPL, including the AGPL's source-offer rules
for network use. The MIT stub, taken by itself, stays MIT.

Neither license grants any right to Halo, its maps, or any other work owned
by Microsoft. No game data is included here.
